{"id":"fe46bf4591982c8e","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-height.md","title":"df-height","display":"df-height","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]"],"label":"56-df-height","aliases":["56-df-height"],"display":"df-height","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-height"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-height</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-height"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-height\"><code>df-height</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)\">\\(k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in T^k\">\\((t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in T^k\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{height}:T\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{height}(x)\\coloneqq0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{height}:T\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{height}(x)\\coloneqq0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{height}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq\n\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{1+\\operatorname{height}(t_i)\\mid1\\le i\\le k\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{height}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq\n\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{1+\\operatorname{height}(t_i)\\mid1\\le i\\le k\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(t)\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{height}(t)\\qquad(t\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(t)\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{height}(t)\\qquad(t\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件 height 以边数计高的约定，并显式给出与原书 depth（最大分支的节点数）的换算。变量与常元的 height 均为0，depth 均为1；原式 max∅ 的漏洞由集合中加入0消除。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，定义2.1.7，印刷第29页，OCR页块50。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-height","text":"`df-height`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-terms]]，$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in T^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{height}:T\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{height}(x)\\coloneqq0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{height}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq\n\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{1+\\operatorname{height}(t_i)\\mid1\\le i\\le k\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}(t)\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{height}(t)\\qquad(t\\in T).","display":true}],"bytes":1166,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-372","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-height]]"}],"outgoing":["5e02461ce48023cc"]}